            "notes": "#1 Single is a good item that we aren't going to be using for the rest of the build because there are items that synergize better with the build. But for now, while we don't have Lumerico & 2 boops, why not. \n\nAside from that, I max out my health total, because I play rather aggressive, and I don't want to die for it. If you're more content being passive, you may prefer leaning more on ability power to heal your team better. \n\nAn underrated aspect of having a lot of health, is that you're messing up a lot of breakpoints for DPSes. Where you might normally die after getting direct hit by soldier rocket then shot by the visor, now you'll be fine. Junkrat's combo won't kill you either, and neither will Genji's.",
