            "notes": "Now you're starting to be pretty tanky. You can start 1v1ing DPSes very consistently. Be careful though, if they get helped, run away. \n\nIf you're not familiar with Lumerico Fusion Drive, it's the best self-sustain item out there if you have a cooldown you can spam, and Lucio has boop. 50 armor/second on top of crowd pleaser on top of your healing aura means you're always in the fight. \n\nIronclad exhaust ports can give you as much as 100 temporary health in the span of 4 seconds, and as such is a must pick for Lucio.",
