            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-04T18:18:45.018491+00:00",
            "notes": "Please note that signature shift, kitsune and tommygun only trigger off of Amp It Up after its full duration and not right after pressing the key. Very annoying, but it is what it is. \n\nThis is where things get OP. Thanks to signature shift + kitsune + tommygun, you can burst down squishies faster than they can react without even having to crit them. If you set up by using an ability beforehand, thus activating all of your buffs, you can even burst down tanks. \n\nAt this point, you can start playing more like a DPS if you want. You can hide and wait to ambush another DPS, or go for flanks, because there's no way you're losing a 1v1 to any other character (unless you miss everything or said character flies, but then you'll be able to run away so whatever). Do keep in mind that you make a lot of noise, and that doing the same thing too many times makes you predictable. Playing with your team is always a safe play.",
